  "wishText":Hey my Valentine ❤️
Sach bolun toh, tum meri life ka woh Punjabi love song ho jo repeat pe chalta rehta hai—soft, warm aur dil se connected. Tum saath ho toh simple sa din bhi special lagta hai, aur tumhari smile… bas wahi meri favourite feeling hai.

